      "summaries": {
        "en": "Awesome System Design Resources is a curated collection of free materials for learning system design concepts and preparing for technical interviews. It organizes resources by topics like scalability, distributed systems, and high-level design, making complex concepts accessible through structured learning paths. Developers can use it to study foundational principles, practice with real-world case studies, and apply these insights to build scalable applications or prepare for system design interviews.",
        "zh": "Awesome System Design Resources 是一个精心整理的系统设计学习资源库，专注于帮助开发者掌握构建可扩展系统的核心概念并准备技术面试。它通过分类整理分布式系统、高可用架构等主题资料，将复杂理论转化为结构化学习路径。用户可从中学习基础原理，分析实际案例，并将这些知识应用于设计高性能后端系统或应对面试中的系统设计挑战，提升工程实践能力。",
        "es": "Awesome System Design Resources is a curated collection of free materials for learning system design concepts and preparing for technical interviews. It organizes resources by topics like scalability, distributed systems, and high-level design, making complex concepts accessible through structured learning paths. Developers can use it to study foundational principles, practice with real-world case studies, and apply these insights to build scalable applications or prepare for system design interviews.",
