      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude Quickstarts is a collection of practical projects that helps developers overcome the initial learning curve when building applications with the Claude API. It provides ready-to-use templates and examples that demonstrate best practices for API integration, prompt engineering, and deployment workflows. Developers can use these projects as starting points for chatbots, content generators, or workflow automation tools, then customize them for specific use cases by modifying prompts and adding business logic.",
        "zh": "Claude Quickstarts 是一个开源项目集合，旨在帮助开发者快速上手 Claude API 的应用开发。它通过提供可直接部署的模板和示例项目，展示了如何高效集成 API、设计提示词以及构建生产级应用的工作流程。这些项目覆盖了聊天机器人、内容生成和自动化工具等典型场景，开发者可以基于这些模板进行修改和扩展，加入自己的业务逻辑，从而快速构建出符合实际需求的 AI 应用。",
        "es": "Claude Quickstarts is a collection of practical projects that helps developers overcome the initial learning curve when building applications with the Claude API. It provides ready-to-use templates and examples that demonstrate best practices for API integration, prompt engineering, and deployment workflows. Developers can use these projects as starting points for chatbots, content generators, or workflow automation tools, then customize them for specific use cases by modifying prompts and adding business logic.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claude-quickstarts gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Claude Quickstarts is a collection of practical projects that helps developers overcome the initial learning curve when building applications with the Claude API. It provides ready-to-use templates and examples that demonstrate best practices for API integration, prompt engineering, and deployment workflows. Developers can use these projects as starting points for chatbots, content generators, or workflow automation tools, then customize them for specific use cases by modifying prompts and adding business logic.",
