      "summaries": {
        "en": "OpenCTI is an open-source cyber threat intelligence platform that helps security teams organize and analyze threat data from multiple sources to improve detection and response capabilities. Its technical strength lies in a graph-based data model that visually connects indicators, campaigns, and threat actors, revealing relationships often missed in traditional databases. Security analysts can deploy it locally to ingest threat feeds, create custom dashboards, and automate enrichment workflows for real-time threat monitoring and investigation.",
        "zh": "OpenCTI是一个开源网络威胁情报平台，旨在帮助安全团队整合和分析来自多源的威胁数据，提升威胁检测与响应效率。其核心采用图数据库模型，将攻击指标、活动战役和威胁组织可视化为互联节点，直观展现传统数据库难以捕捉的关联关系。用户可本地部署该平台，导入威胁情报源，构建自定义仪表板，并通过自动化工作流实现实时威胁监控与调查分析，适用于企业安全运营、威胁狩猎和情报共享等场景。",
        "es": "OpenCTI is an open-source cyber threat intelligence platform that helps security teams organize and analyze threat data from multiple sources to improve detection and response capabilities. Its technical strength lies in a graph-based data model that visually connects indicators, campaigns, and threat actors, revealing relationships often missed in traditional databases. Security analysts can deploy it locally to ingest threat feeds, create custom dashboards, and automate enrichment workflows for real-time threat monitoring and investigation.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "opencti stands out for cti, cyber, and cybersecurity in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "OpenCTI is an open-source cyber threat intelligence platform that helps security teams organize and analyze threat data from multiple sources to improve detection and response capabilities. Its technical strength lies in a graph-based data model that visually connects indicators, campaigns, and threat actors, revealing relationships often missed in traditional databases. Security analysts can deploy it locally to ingest threat feeds, create custom dashboards, and automate enrichment workflows for real-time threat monitoring and investigation.",
